{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b06e385130173285","name":"Kal Jorek","source":{"id":"source:reference-b06e385130173285","title":"Kal Jorek","revision":21202,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:20:50Z","sha256":"e1c2280e85e3cee0f96f773b2f0231a7647454464f61c674f877db54f0d6afd0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21202","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Kal%20Jorek&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b06e385130173285","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A low-grade weapons smuggler, Kal Jorek has been upsetting peaceful systems for years by importing illegal weapons. Jorek creates a demand for his wares by promoting chaos and fear, after which the local populace comes to him for weapons to protect themselves. Jorek, who ultimately answers to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nar Shaddaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nar_Shaddaa","referenceId":"reference:69680e00e40913c9"},", leads a small band of thugs, which includes his right-hand \"man,\" a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defel","referenceId":"reference:80589d956d21b6e7"}," he calls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frizz"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frizz","referenceId":"reference:56fd2307a0810ad1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When he sees the heroes, Kal Jorek uses his ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Disruptive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disruptive"}]}," Talent, spending 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to topple the card table and the cards, drinks, and credit chips resting on it. Until the start of his next turn, he suppresses all morale and insight bonuses of the heroes within his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". Jorek then uses his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to activate his ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Inspire Confidence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inspire_Confidence"}]}," Talent, granting a +1 morale bonus to the attack rolls and skill checks of allies within his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," until the end of the encounter (unless he becomes unconscious or dies). Additionally, he uses the table as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," as long as the heroes are at range. Whenever Jorek has 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to spare, he uses ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Disruptive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disruptive"}]}," again to cause further chaos.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Kal Jorek Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/N